  "user": "Give me reason code for transaction TX-0401 with amount 240.00 EUR.",
  "answer": "Transaction TX-0401 has no reason code on file. It is a settled card payment of EUR 240.00 to TechMart Online on 2026-07-20. A dispute needs one of these reason codes:\n\n- **duplicate_charge**: the same charge was made more than once\n- **fraud_card_not_present**: a card-not-present payment you did not make\n- **goods_not_received**: you paid but did not receive the goods\n- **service_not_rendered**: you paid but did not receive the service\n- **unauthorized_debit**: a debit you did not authorise\n\nYour account also shows TX-0402, a settled EUR 240.00 card payment to the same merchant on 2026-07-14. If you were charged twice for the same purchase, **duplicate_charge** would be the relevant code. If you did not make either payment, the relevant code would be **unauthorized_debit** or **fraud_card_not_present**.\n\nTell me which situation applies and I will check whether TX-0401 is eligible for a dispute under that code before anything is filed. I will not open a dispute without your confirmation.",
